"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅感 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"塞北江南迢递，春花夜月阑珊。\n送客无情芳草，催人有意青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6505,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅感 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"杨柳闺中寄恨，梅花岭下相思。\n试问红颜几度，春风频自伤离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6506,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨溪洞四时歌 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"十年踪迹愧名山，一入松扉竟未还。\n偶记桃华归去后，遂传春色到人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6507,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨溪洞四时歌 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"长松落落荫丹霄，策杖看花过野桥。\n更有薰风生涧底，入云清切间萧韶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6508,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨溪洞四时歌 其三","author":"黎民表","text":"我梦霓衣历紫宫，瑶华如雨散西风。\n偶逢子晋曾相约，后夜乘鸾向月中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6509,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨溪洞四时歌 其四","author":"黎民表","text":"四序回环验落花，岩扉苔径足烟霞。\n青山不用频招隐，自有寒松共岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6510,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和子乾舟行 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"溪流东去水云深，十载青山负夙心。\n今日停舟聊一望，几时携鹤住枫林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6511,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和子乾舟行 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"两岸清沙映落红，溪头知有夜来风。\n扁舟却恨寻春晚，不见桃花二月中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6512,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑苏曲 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"宝带桥西柳作花，吴王宫殿冷栖鸦。\n蛾眉邀得旁人顾，日暮江边自浣纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6513,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑苏曲 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"横塘清浅映红妆，摘叶攀花持赠郎。\n浮萍飘泊无根蒂，不似芙蓉到死香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6514,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧芝山房为传木虚弟木剡作 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"茆盈兄弟昔餐霞，回首松门几度花。\n留得玉芝逾橘井，炼成金骨胜丹砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6515,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧芝山房为传木虚弟木剡作 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"新种龙仙叶叶长，春风吹作辟邪香。\n那能白日骖鸾去，手把璚枝献紫皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6516,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧芝山房为传木虚弟木剡作 其三","author":"黎民表","text":"高卧深山抱玉书，商歌一曲意何如。\n只愁四海云罗密，又出人间护汉储。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6517,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧芝山房为传木虚弟木剡作 其四","author":"黎民表","text":"闭门日日草玄文，阶下熏成五色云。\n灵药不将鸡犬试，仙坛今已候王君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6518,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"汉主离宫太液傍，舞台妆榭映垂杨。\n林穿翡翠浑无色，花拂琼蕤并是香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6519,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"宝月团圆开素波，宫娥前队引笙歌。\n白云乡远应难到，争似琳池乐更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6520,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其五","author":"黎民表","text":"祥鸦飞散曙光微，鱼钥沉沉昼漏稀。\n唯见玉关驰露布，不闻金殿坐霄衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6521,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]